cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "Native Language Identification: cross-corpus audit of SVM and LLM systems"
abstract: >-
  Code for a cross-corpus audit of native language identification (NLI):
  a TF-IDF + LinearSVC classifier trained on TOEFL11 and a zero-shot LLM,
  both evaluated on TOEFL11 and ICLEv3, with three audits for corpus
  artifacts that can inflate NLI accuracy (document-ID headers,
  self-disclosure of nationality, and topic exclusivity).
